    <briefdescription>
<para>Background health monitor for the pooled database connections. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>On construction it starts a background work thread that periodically leases one connection, checks it, and reconnects it if the link is lost (also triggering a reconnect of all idle connections through the pool). The monitor flag is atomic so the destructor can signal shutdown and then join the thread. Non-copyable and non-movable. <simplesect kind="note"><para>The destructor may block for up to one check interval while the thread wakes up. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classDatabaseHanndler" kindref="compound">DatabaseHanndler</ref>, <ref refid="classDatabaseConnectionPool_1a51134b38454f5146921c081fbf2ad5f3" kindref="member">DatabaseConnectionPool::reconnect_all</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
